Subject: [PATCH] concrt140: implement the concurrent queue iterator ABI

Forza Horizon 6 reaches shader compilation but aborts on the unimplemented
iterator constructor. Implement construction, independent copying, assignment,
advancement and destruction over the existing private queue representation.
The exported object retains its two-pointer MSVC ABI.

Validated with tests/concrt_queue_iterator.c against this implementation and
the Microsoft VC++ 14.44 redistributable: FIFO traversal across page boundaries,
multiple element sizes, partial consumption, independent copies and end state.

